  //    GPU work). Readbacks drop from 1/token to 1/BATCH, all off the critical path. The hybrid state
  //    (full-attn KV rows, linear-layer SSM S + convTail) is SEQUENTIAL — each position's dispatches mutate
  //    the persistent buffers in submission order, and WebGPU's in-pass hazard barriers serialize them, so
  //    recording B positions back-to-back in one encoder advances the recurrence correctly. ──
  let DEC = null;
